  "interpretation": [
    "The constant-index local context writer implementation coincides with elimination of recipe LUTRAM and increased FF mapping; it is the main area cost. No new algorithmic data capacity is claimed.",
    "Recipe exclusive FF increases 4052/2067/4079 for P12U1/P6U1/P12U2 while LUTRAM decreases 224/224/228 to zero.",
    "H2 increases SHA256 LUTs by2550/1379 in the two U1 points, with FF slightly lower; U2 SHA256 increase is only308 LUTs.",
    "The recipe changes and H2 were measured as a combined candidate; hierarchical attribution locates resource increments but is not a controlled single-change synthesis ablation.",
    "Hardware timing and ATP remain independently measured at hard targets; synthesis hierarchy does not prove frequency."
